      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CLASS\n→ Blueprint\n\nOBJECT\n→ Instance created from a class\n\nREFERENCE VARIABLE\n→ Used to access/reference an object\n\nINSTANCE METHOD\n→ Method called through an object\n\nnew\n→ Creates an object",
      "autoResize": true,
