      "text": "Scanner\n↓\nJava library class for taking input\n\nScanner s = new Scanner(System.in);\n\nScanner       → type/class\ns             → reference variable\nnew Scanner() → creates Scanner object\nSystem.in     → keyboard input\n\ns.nextInt()   → reads an integer\ns.nextDouble()→ reads a decimal\ns.next()      → reads one word\ns.nextLine()  → reads a whole line",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scanner\n↓\nJava library class for taking input\n\nScanner s = new Scanner(System.in);\n\nScanner       → type/class\ns             → reference variable\nnew Scanner() → creates Scanner object\nSystem.in     → keyboard input\n\ns.nextInt()   → reads an integer\ns.nextDouble()→ reads a decimal\ns.next()      → reads one word\ns.nextLine()  → reads a whole line",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
