      "text": "Scanner\n│\n├── nextInt()        → reads an integer\n│                      Example: 25\n│\n├── nextLong()       → reads a long integer\n│                      Example: 10000000000\n│\n├── nextDouble()     → reads a decimal number\n│                      Example: 5.75\n│\n├── nextFloat()      → reads a float\n│                      Example: 5.75\n│\n├── next()           → reads ONE word\n│                      \"Anurag Kumar\" → \"Anurag\"\n│\n├── nextLine()       → reads the WHOLE line\n│                      \"Anurag Kumar\" → \"Anurag Kumar\"\n│\n├── nextBoolean()    → reads true / false\n│                      Example: true\n│\n├── hasNextInt()     → checks if next input is an integer\n│                      Returns: true / false\n│\n└── hasNext()        → checks if more input exists\n                       Returns: true / false",
